<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound interbank rates fall in week-end mkt.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound interbank rates fall in week-end mkt.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound fell on Thursday in an end-of-week liquid private sector market to between seven and 8-1/2 percent from eight and 8-15/16 percent on Wednesday, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates also slipped to between 8-1/4 and 8-3/4 percent from 8-1/4 and 9-1/8, the bankers added.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
